# 059-options.lua

The recipients module's undecided choices, for the options tally
(`scripts/tally-options`, issue 106).  `dofile` it; it returns a list of
tables in the shape given in `docs/phase-1-module-contract.md` ("The options
tally"): `id`, `question`, `waits_on` (`"owner"` or `"state"`), `detail`,
`config_key` (`""` when not switchable), `variants` (each `name`, `summary`,
`built_in`, `tests`, `findings`, all strings) and `leaning`.

Choices listed: reply list on arrival (open question 2), split shape, split
room's parent, split of a room of two, name of a room made on arrival, and
where a room made on arrival goes in the tree (waits on phase 2).
